   "en": "",
   "status": "todo"
  },
  {
   "id": "RES#4116:998f",
   "off": 39311,
   "len": 16,
   "bank": "0.1",
   "jp": "{0c:2b1f23080001511010010c0ffe}",
   "raw": null,
   "en": "",
   "status": "todo"
  },
  {
   "id": "RES#4116:999f",
   "off": 39327,
   "len": 102,
   "bank": "0.1",
   "jp": "なんだその目は。\n俺とやるってのか?{1a}俺は別に樺わねえぜ。\nいや、むしろその方がありがてえな。\n忘れようにも忘れられねえ恨みなんぞ\nクサるほどあるんだからよ。{0c:2b1e23080001fe}",
   "raw": null,
   "en": "",
   "status": "todo"
  },
  {
   "id": "RES#4116:9a05",
   "off": 39429,
   "len": 16,
   "bank": "0.1",
   "jp": "{0c:2b1e23080001511010030c0ffe}",
   "raw": null,
   "en": "",
   "status": "todo"
  },
  {
   "id": "RES#4116:9a15",
   "off": 39445,
   "len": 14,
   "bank": "0.1",
